  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tCorporation Tax\n\t\tCorporation Tax FAQs\n\n### submission error:-  You must provide a set of iXBRL accounts if the &#39;No accounts reason&#39; is absent.  I have attached a PDF copy of the statutory accounts.\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Wed, 27 Mar, 2019 at  3:17 PM\n\n\t\tWe have checked and found that you have not selected the option \"PDF Accounts attached with explanation\" under \"Accounts and Computations Included\" (refer attached), hence the reason. Please select the same to resolve the issue and you may proceed with the submission of CT Returns as desired. \n\n\t\tStep 1.png (21 KB) Step 2.png (10.1 KB) \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115346\">Corporation Tax</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188546\">Corporation Tax FAQs</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">submission error:-  You must provide a set of iXBRL accounts if the &#39;No accounts reason&#39; is absent.  I have attached a PDF copy of the statutory accounts.\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Wed, 27 Mar, 2019 at  3:17 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">We have checked and found that you have not selected the option \"PDF Accounts attached with explanation\" under \"Accounts and Computations Included\" (refer attached), hence the reason. Please select the same to resolve the issue and you may proceed with the submission of CT Returns as desired. </span><p><br></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t<div class=\"cs-g-c attachments\" id=\"article-9000165814-attachments\"><div class=\"attachment\"><img src=\"/images/helpdesk/attachments/9074344266/thumb\" onerror=\"default_image_error(this)\" class=\"file-thumbnail image\" alt=\"Step 1.png\"><div class=\"attach_content\"><div class=\"ellipsis\"><a href=\"/helpdesk/attachments/9074344266\" class=\"filename\" target=\"_blank\" \n                >Step 1.png </a></div><div>(21 KB) </div></div></div><div class=\"attachment\"><img src=\"/images/helpdesk/attachments/9074344268/thumb\" onerror=\"default_image_error(this)\" class=\"fi